{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1PE",
  "chapter": 5,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The elders who are among you I exhort, who am also an elder, and a witness of the sufferings of Christ, and also a partaker of the glory that shall be revealed:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Feed the flock of God which is among you, taking the oversight ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", not by constraint, but willingly; not for filthy lucre, but from a ready mind;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither as being lords over ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "God's",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " heritage, but being examples to the flock.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when the chief Shepherd shall appear, ye shall receive a crown of glory that fadeth not away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Likewise, ye younger, submit yourselves to the elder. Yes, all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " be subject one to another, and be clothed with humility: for God resisteth the proud, and giveth grace to the humble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Humble yourselves therefore under the mighty hand of God, that he may exalt you in due time:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Casting all your care upon him; for he careth for you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be sober, be vigilant; because your adversary the devil, as a roaring lion, walketh about, seeking whom he may devour:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whom resist steadfast in the faith, knowing that the same afflictions are accomplished in your brethren that are in the world.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the God of all grace, who hath called us to his eternal glory by Christ Jesus, after ye have suffered a while, make you perfect, establish, strengthen, settle ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory and dominion for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By Silvanus, a faithful brother to you, as I suppose, I have written briefly, exhorting, and testifying that this is the true grace of God in which ye stand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "church that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at Babylon, elected together with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", saluteth you; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so doth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Mark my son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PE.5.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1PE.5.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Greet ye one another with a kiss of charity. Peace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with you all that are in Christ Jesus. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
